     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "B2 in context",
     "texto": [
      "**Bir yandan ... öte yandan ...** («on the one hand... on the other...») lets you balance two evaluations. The passives **sahnelendi** («was staged») and **bestelendi** («was composed») focus attention on the work and the music.",
      "Compare the evaluations and locate the passive forms you hear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
